            "message": "<div class=\"upload-instructions\">\r\n\r\n<b>Recommended Size:<\/b> Minimum 356px by 531px (Regular Display) - Maximum 534px by 800px (Retina Display) - (width x height)<br \/>\r\n\r\n<b>Recommended Size For Icon :<\/b> Minimum 111px by 110px (Regular Display) - Maximum 222px by 220px (Retina Display) - (width x height)<br \/>\r\n\r\n<b>Image \/ Icon  Height:<\/b> Height of the image \/ icon  can vary slightly due to aspect ratio, but width of image must meet the recommended size.<br \/>\r\n\r\n<b>Resources:<\/b> Make sure to upload a compressed image in <i>.WEBP<\/i> image format. - <a href=\"https:\/\/image.online-convert.com\/convert-to-webp\" target=\"_blank\">Convert Images to WEBP<\/a> - <a href=\"https:\/\/tinypng.com\/\" target=\"_blank\">Compress WEBP Images<\/a>\r\n\r\n<\/div>",
